{"articleNo":"135845","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=135845&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[8.31~9.8]2015-2 열린사이버대학교(OCU) 학점교류 수강료 납부 방법 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.09.01","hit":"5839","attachments":[{"name":"OCU 시스템사용료 수납방법 및 절차.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=135845&attachNo=4421"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015학년도 2학기 열린사이버대학교(OCU) 학점교류 수강료 납부 방법&nbsp;안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가. 수강료 금액 : 과목당 24,000원(본인 부담)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나. 납부 기간 : 2015. 8. 31.(월) ~ 9. 8.(화) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">[ 미납 시 자동 수강취소 ]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다. 납부방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) OCU컨소시엄 홈페이지(cons.ocu.ac.kr) 로그인 후 [시스템사용료 납부]메뉴를 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 이용하여 납부(붙임참조)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2) 로그인 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: ID : kit + 학번, 최초PASSWORD : kit + 학번</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 납부유형 : 실시간 계좌이체, 신용카드, 가상계좌(무통장입금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp;4) 납부확인 : [시스템사용료 납부 확인]메뉴에서 확인가능</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
